      "request_id": "401f0a6002b302c26dc5a2113c07387575c2e1f129ee08101ad3c6cadeafd0b5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9efe606726014d2d608449b76a4f172a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "丢掉一盘之后，重新把比赛赢回来。现在，她终于可以接过属于自己的奖盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5773ee195c3789b986a3eb7c8bda45f2f5f80a6121988670ec8f08260dafad57",
      "words_sha256": "bdc39dead814339842104e2b54484a120bf38d9ae392788819286b7595f1645a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6234d6be6c1e469ede25de44ac1374d8e0d49f7908001affd1beb03799de7c80",
      "request_id": "6234d6be6c1e469ede25de44ac1374d8e0d49f7908001affd1beb03799de7c80",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5bccb8476bd94e8c6b3edaffb3754fd4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘五比二领先，第一次发球胜盘却没成功。对手追到四比五，施奈德必须再来一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "626b81ed4938007a67eaf6ab12df919a646b7c0adceb504ecc7e582b26f8fc09",
      "words_sha256": "cc48d3adcbb1ca3117898a6964814f8b6125f0258bd0005d72ad4d4bf4d4d567"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:760efb058348ee9c9c0facb2c794a305c29907e47f46fef64a0cfb1f32a89933",
      "request_id": "760efb058348ee9c9c0facb2c794a305c29907e47f46fef64a0cfb1f32a89933",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f7b6af7b82ab23b86ccd820a98a9d17c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "看这一拍，施奈德先把对手压在底线，再跟进网前截击。她主动缩短回合，要把领先的优势继续扩大，不给对手轻松调整的机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1e328dd8a3c3e8a19d21e007a222a2880173738dee5cf12fbb47d1bdf07156ae",
      "words_sha256": "866e56b9948fa41186684b2d4c7f2908b718a3bc70e65941d382b53343c8ae34"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:77bbd19774075fce49ed15da856e796734421ea89221f1a630b5d8ebe78b8f37",
      "request_id": "77bbd19774075fce49ed15da856e796734421ea89221f1a630b5d8ebe78b8f37",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "470e9915a5989aceb3f1d02ca3ce9a6d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘四比零，冠军只差两局。可费尔南德斯没有退让，这场决赛的转折，从这里开始。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1a4fb00d7fcde36902b7511b9a5ba45719e0d17b615cb8a5e311e216e41d3cf5",
